    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35927" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνοικος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>inhabitant,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				611
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. θεός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hierocl.
					<u>in CA</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				p.441
			</span></i> M.: mostly c. gen. loci, <i>inhabitant of</i> a place,
				<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				415
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				1092
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.61
			</span></i>, etc.: c. dat., <i>dweller in</i> a place, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Criti.</u>
				113c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑσμὸς τεχνιτῶν ἔνοικος πόλει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Limen.
					20
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>dwelt in,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Παλλάδος ἔνοικα μέλαθρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ion</u>
					235
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.) (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Παλλάδι
			συν-</span>)</div>
